######## V. Values stay out of the agent's sight

$ kagebunshin run -- sh -c 'echo "key is $API_KEY"'
key is <redacted:API_KEY>

$ kagebunshin get API_KEY
kagebunshin: cannot read a passphrase from the terminal: No such device or address (os error 6)
hint: run this in an interactive terminal
[exit 1]

(human) $ kagebunshin get API_URL
Passphrase for the local store: 
https://api.dev.acme.test

(human) $ kagebunshin get LOG_LEVEL
Passphrase for the local store: 
kagebunshin: environment dev of project api has no key LOG_LEVEL
[exit 1]

$ kagebunshin audit | grep -E 'api/prod|api/rc|shop/prod' | tail -20
<time> allowed project add-env shop/prod pid <n>
<time> allowed mark env api/rc pid <n>
