<time> denied  status api/prod pid <n>: refusing environment prod of project api: it is marked sensitive
<time> allowed ask approval api/prod pid <n> program ./test.sh keys API_KEY,API_URL,DATABASE_URL,LOG_LEVEL,SIGNING_KEY (run)
<time> denied  run api/prod pid <n> program ./test.sh: refusing environment prod of project api: it is marked sensitive; handing it out takes approval in the app, which is not open
