<time> timeout run api/prod pid <n> program ./test.sh: environment prod of project api: nobody answered the request within 3 seconds, so nothing was handed out. It asked for every value of the environment, which is marked sensitive
<time> allowed ask approval api/prod pid <n> program ./test.sh keys API_KEY,API_URL,DATABASE_URL,LOG_LEVEL,SIGNING_KEY (run)
<time> denied  run api/prod pid <n> program ./test.sh: environment prod of project api: a person denied the request, so nothing was handed out. It asked for every value of the environment, which is marked sensitive
